      "statement": "The delivery projection maps each Context to exactly one DeliveryService whose id is `service.<contextRef without the `context.` prefix>` and whose lane is the last dotted segment of the Context id; services are sorted by Context id and links by link id, so two runs of the projector name the same boundaries.",
